---
// Quiz figure for go-testing-table-tests set 01 (s01q5): the three table rows with input, what Parse returns and what the row wants, next to the printed output.
// It shows the data and the real output; it does not say why only one failure is printed.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq06ro">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 300" role="img" aria-label="A table of three test rows with input, value returned by Parse and wanted value, and below it the output printed by go test: one FAIL line for TestParse.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq06ro-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The three rows and what go test printed</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ba dòng của bảng và những gì go test in ra</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="10" y="34" width="560" height="30" rx="6" class="qfig-gq06ro-card" />
    <text x="24" y="54" class="qfig-gq06ro-w">name</text>
    <text x="190" y="54" class="qfig-gq06ro-w">input</text>
    <text x="300" y="54" class="qfig-gq06ro-w">Parse returns</text>
    <text x="450" y="54" class="qfig-gq06ro-w">want</text>

    <text x="24" y="86" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">normal port</text>
    <text x="190" y="86" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">"8080"</text>
    <text x="300" y="86" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">8080</text>
    <text x="450" y="86" class="qfig-gq06ro-bad">8081</text>

    <line x1="10" x2="570" y1="98" y2="98" class="qfig-gq06ro-sep" />
    <text x="24" y="120" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">zero</text>
    <text x="190" y="120" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">"0"</text>
    <text x="300" y="120" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">0, error</text>
    <text x="450" y="120" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">0, wantErr</text>

    <line x1="10" x2="570" y1="132" y2="132" class="qfig-gq06ro-sep" />
    <text x="24" y="154" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">too big</text>
    <text x="190" y="154" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">"65536"</text>
    <text x="300" y="154" class="qfig-gq06ro-m">0, error</text>
    <text x="450" y="154" class="qfig-gq06ro-bad">1, wantErr</text>

    <rect x="10" y="180" width="560" height="102" rx="8" class="qfig-gq06ro-card" />
    <text x="24" y="202" class="qfig-gq06ro-c">$ go test</text>
    <text x="24" y="224" class="qfig-gq06ro-c">--- FAIL: TestParse (0.00s)</text>
    <text x="24" y="244" class="qfig-gq06ro-c">    port_test.go:22: normal port: Parse("8080") = 8080, want 8081</text>
    <text x="24" y="264" class="qfig-gq06ro-c">FAIL</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq06ro { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq06ro svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq06ro text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq06ro .qfig-gq06ro-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq06ro .qfig-gq06ro-w { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq06ro .qfig-gq06ro-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq06ro .qfig-gq06ro-bad { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-gq06ro .qfig-gq06ro-c { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq06ro-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .qfig-gq06ro-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
</style>
